OL,3,GNEWSAArtist paints mural of Sam Smith's
OL,4,ABrewery horses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural celebrating Samuel Smith's
OL,7,FBrewery's iconic shire horses has been
OL,8,Fpainted on a boarded-up shop front
OL,9,Fclose to its headquarters in Tadcaster.
OL,11,FThe artwork sits in the shadow of the
OL,12,Fbrewery and the Angel and White Horse
OL,13,FInn - where the shire horses are
OL,14,Fstabled and remain one of town's
OL,15,Ffamiliar sights.
OL,17,FLocal artist Claire Bentley-Smith said
OL,18,Fshe created the mural as a tribute to
OL,19,Fthe brewery's owner, the late Humphrey
OL,20,FSmith, and to the animals that deliver
OL,21,Fbeer around the town.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
