OL,3,GNEWSAArtist paints mural of Sam Smith's
OL,4,ABrewery horses
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe added: "I'm lucky enough that the
OL,7,Fshire horses from the brewery come past
OL,8,Fmy house every morning, and as an
OL,9,Fequestrian artist I've always found
OL,10,Fthat incredibly inspiring."
